<title>USA: Coastal Bancorp acquires Wells Fargo branch.</title>
<headline>Coastal Bancorp acquires Wells Fargo branch.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Bancorp Inc's Coastal banc ssb subsidiary said Monday that it has completed the acquisition of Wells Fargo and Co's bank branch in Port Arthur, Texas, which has about $58 million in deposits.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Coastal said the transaction would further expand its market presence in small- to mid-sized cities in southeast Texas.</p>
<p>At March 31, Coastal had $2.9 billion in total assets and $1.3 billion in total deposits.</p>
</text>
